PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786925885
OL,3,CApp feature allows deaf festivalgoers
OL,4,Cto book BSL interpreters for Fringe
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FDeaf festivalgoers at this year's
OL,8,FFringe can now request British Sign
OL,9,FLanguage (BSL) interpreters for shows
OL,10,Fthrough an "innovative" mobile app
OL,11,Ffeature, a charity has announced.
OL,13,FThe technology is part of the SignPort
OL,14,Fmobile app, which was launched last
OL,15,Fyear by Deaf Action to connect deaf
OL,16,Fpeople with BSL interpreters.
OL,26,@rD@LOUrD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786925885
OL,3,CApp feature allows deaf festivalgoers
OL,4,Cto book BSL interpreters for Fringe
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FThe feature brings together show
OL,8,Finformation in one searchable
OL,9,Fcatalogue, enabling users to browse
OL,10,Fperformances, search by venue or type
OL,11,Fof show, and request an interpreter
OL,12,Ffor up to two performances per person.
OL,14,FOf the more than 3,000 shows at this
OL,15,Fyear's Fringe, only around 2.4% are
OL,16,Fcurrently set to feature BSL
OL,17,Finterpretation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786925885
OL,3,CApp feature allows deaf festivalgoers
OL,4,Cto book BSL interpreters for Fringe
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FDeaf Action said the app update is
OL,8,Fanother step forward in opening up
OL,9,Fmore performances to deaf audiences,
OL,10,Fgiving them greater choice and
OL,11,Fflexibility when planning their Fringe
OL,12,Fexperience.
OL,14,FNathan Rollinson, 36, who has been
OL,15,Fdeaf since birth, said the technology
OL,16,Fwill help reduce the barriers that can
OL,17,Fmake it difficult for deaf people to
OL,18,Faccess live performances.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786925885
OL,3,CApp feature allows deaf festivalgoers
OL,4,Cto book BSL interpreters for Fringe
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,F"It has been very frustrating and
OL,8,Fdisappointing at times, especially
OL,9,Fwhen you want to enjoy the same
OL,10,Fcultural experiences as everyone else
OL,11,Fbut cannot easily find information
OL,12,Fabout BSL-interpreted performances,"
OL,13,Fhe said.
OL,15,F"The Fringe has so many shows but
OL,16,Fwithout clear access information, it
OL,17,Fcan feel overwhelming and discouraging.
OL,19,F"SignPort has helped so much already.
OL,20,FIt makes the process much smoother,
OL,21,Fclearer and more effective.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@dO]wD@AOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786925885
OL,3,CApp feature allows deaf festivalgoers
OL,4,Cto book BSL interpreters for Fringe
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,F"Having an easy way to find BSL-
OL,8,Finterpreted performances and book
OL,9,Finterpreters will make a real
OL,10,Fdifference for deaf audiences.
OL,12,F"It removes a lot of barriers and
OL,13,Fmakes the performing arts feel much
OL,14,Fmore accessible."
OL,16,FOnce a request has been submitted
OL,17,Fthrough the app, Deaf Action's
OL,18,Fbookings team works with the
OL,19,Fperformer, venue and available
OL,20,Finterpreters to establish whether the
OL,21,Fperformance can be made accessible.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUvD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786925885
OL,3,CApp feature allows deaf festivalgoers
OL,4,Cto book BSL interpreters for Fringe
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FUsers can also communicate with those
OL,8,Farranging the booking, view details of
OL,9,Fthe interpreter and follow a direct
OL,10,Flink to purchase their ticket.
OL,12,FMercy Cherono, SignPort's manager,
OL,13,Fsaid: "The Edinburgh Festival Fringe
OL,14,Finvolves thousands of performances as
OL,15,Fwell as audiences, interpreters,
OL,16,Fartists and venues.
OL,18,F"For deaf people, it also opens the
OL,19,Fdoor to cultural experiences that have
OL,20,Ftraditionally been difficult to access.
OL,26,@uD@GOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786925885
OL,3,CApp feature allows deaf festivalgoers
OL,4,Cto book BSL interpreters for Fringe
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,F"By making it easier to request
OL,8,Finterpretation, we're helping deaf
OL,9,Faudiences discover more performances,
OL,10,Fwhile shining a spotlight on deaf
OL,11,Fartists, deaf-led productions and
OL,12,Finclusive theatre."
OL,14,FShe added that if the technology can
OL,15,Fhelp improve access across a programme
OL,16,Fof this scale, it could be adapted for
OL,17,Fthings like hospital appointments,
OL,18,Fcouncil services, workplaces,
OL,19,Fconferences and major events.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
