PN,30208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786925885
OL,3,CApp feature allows deaf festivalgoers
OL,4,Cto book BSL interpreters for Fringe
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FThe feature was developed specifically
OL,8,Ffor this year's festival, with the
OL,9,Fcost of the BSL translation services
OL,10,Fbeing covered by a #5,000 grant from
OL,11,Fthe Edinburgh Festival Fringe Society.
OL,13,FDeaf Action chief executive Phillip
OL,14,FGerrard said the charity is
OL,15,F"incredibly grateful" to the Fringe
OL,16,FSociety for supporting the pilot.
OL,26,@wD@AOUwD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786925885
OL,3,CApp feature allows deaf festivalgoers
OL,4,Cto book BSL interpreters for Fringe
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,F"It demonstrates a genuine commitment
OL,8,Fto improving accessibility and gives
OL,9,Fus the opportunity to test an
OL,10,Finnovative approach that puts more
OL,11,Fchoice into the hands of deaf
OL,12,Faudiences," he said.
OL,14,F"Our hope is that this is only the
OL,15,Fbeginning.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@KO]vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786925885
OL,3,CApp feature allows deaf festivalgoers
OL,4,Cto book BSL interpreters for Fringe
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,F"If similar investment could be
OL,8,Fsecured from across Edinburgh's
OL,9,Ffestivals and cultural organisations,
OL,10,Fwe could build on this success and
OL,11,Fcreate a city-wide interpreter request
OL,12,Fscheme that helps make Edinburgh one
OL,13,Fof the world's most accessible
OL,14,Ffestival cities for deaf people."
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
