FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786925885
OL,3,CApp feature allows deaf festivalgoers
OL,4,Cto book BSL interpreters for Fringe
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FWestaly Duignan, head of fundraising
OL,8,Fand strategic relationships at the
OL,9,FFringe Society, said: "The Edinburgh
OL,10,FFestival Fringe Society has worked
OL,11,Fwith Deaf Action for the past three
OL,12,Fyears to deliver the BSL on request
OL,13,Fscheme, enabling 16 shows to provide
OL,14,FBSL interpretation.
OL,16,F"We are delighted that Deaf Action has
OL,17,Fdeveloped a new approach that allows
OL,18,FBSL users to quickly and easily
OL,19,Frequest an interpreter for the Fringe
OL,20,Fshow of their choice."
OL,26,@qD@WOUxD@AOU|D@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30212
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786925885
OL,3,CApp feature allows deaf festivalgoers
OL,4,Cto book BSL interpreters for Fringe
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FMr Rollinson, who works as a
OL,8,Fphotographer and tastemaker, said he
OL,9,Fused the technology to book an
OL,10,Finterpreter for two shows at this
OL,11,Fyear's festival.
OL,13,F"I'd appeal to potential funders to
OL,14,Frecognise how important equal access
OL,15,Fto culture is for deaf people," he
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,F"More funding would mean more
OL,19,Favailability, better access and more
OL,20,Fopportunities for deaf audiences to
OL,21,Ffully participate in the arts."
OL,26,@uD@AOUwD@_O]zD@AOU}D@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
